The 6 God seemed to be having a blast as the Colombian superstar took over the Rogers Centre for the night. Drake even made a guest appearance on the Jumbotron, which saw him grinning from ear to ear, flexing an expensive watch from his collection and dancing.

Radio host Charlamagne Tha God had fueled rumors that Karol G had a collaboration with Drake on Drizzy’s ICEMAN album in May, which turned out to be false. However, Drake ended up shouting out the Grammy-winning singer on MAID OF HONOUR ’s “New Bestie.” “Yeah, I want a Latina, I want a Latina/ I want a G like Karolina,” he raps.

Wednesday’s Viajando Por El Mundo Tropitour stop in Toronto was a special one, as Karol G announced her new album , No Me Arrepiento de Sentir Tanto , which is set to arrive on Aug. 7. The album&#8217;s title translates to “I Don’t Regret Feeling So Much,” and serves as the follow-up to 2025’s Tropicoqueta, which debuted at No. 3 on the Billboard 200. Also coming up for the singer? A star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame. The news about her latest honor was announced on July 23.

The North American leg of Karol G’s Viajando Por El Mundo Tropitour continues throughout August with stadium stops in D.C., Las Vegas, Los Angeles, San Francisco, Seattle and Phoenix.
